<h2 class="mb-4">Aims &amp; Objectives</h2>

<ul class="ps-4 lh-lg mb-0">
    <li class="mb-3 d-flex">
        <i class="bi bi-dot fs-4 me-2 text-secondary"></i>
        <div>
            <strong>Cultivate a reading culture</strong> by maintaining diverse, community-driven 
            collections and reading clubs.
        </div>
    </li>

    <li class="mb-3 d-flex">
        <i class="bi bi-dot fs-4 me-2 text-secondary"></i>
        <div>
            <strong>Advance digital literacy</strong> with free internet, e-learning workshops, 
            and one-on-one tech help.
        </div>
    </li>

    <li class="mb-3 d-flex">
        <i class="bi bi-dot fs-4 me-2 text-secondary"></i>
        <div>
            <strong>Support formal education</strong> through homework-help desks, school outreach, 
            and exam-resource corners.
        </div>
    </li>

    <li class="mb-3 d-flex">
        <i class="bi bi-dot fs-4 me-2 text-secondary"></i>
        <div>
            <strong>Preserve and promote local heritage</strong> via a dedicated Kothmale–Mahaweli archive, 
            oral-history projects, and rare-document digitisation.
        </div>
    </li>

    <li class="mb-3 d-flex">
        <i class="bi bi-dot fs-4 me-2 text-secondary"></i>
        <div>
            <strong>Strengthen social cohesion</strong> by offering inclusive programmes in Sinhala, Tamil, and English, and by 
            ensuring accessibility for patrons with disabilities.
        </div>
    </li>
</ul>


